{"key":"data","name":"Data science","words":[["die","Datenwissenschaft","data science","Ich arbeite in der Datenwissenschaft.","I work in data science."],["der","Datenwissenschaftler","data scientist (male)","Er ist Datenwissenschaftler bei einer Bank.","He is a data scientist at a bank."],["die","Datenwissenschaftlerin","data scientist (female)","Sie arbeitet als Datenwissenschaftlerin.","She works as a data scientist."],["die","Daten","data (plural)","Die Daten sind unvollständig.","The data is incomplete."],["der","Datensatz","dataset / record","Der Datensatz hat zehntausend Zeilen.","The dataset has ten thousand rows."],["die","Datenbank","database","Die Daten liegen in einer Datenbank.","The data is stored in a database."],["die","Tabelle","table / spreadsheet","Die Tabelle hat zu viele Spalten.","The table has too many columns."],["die","Spalte","column","Diese Spalte enthält das Datum.","This column contains the date."],["die","Zeile","row / line","Lösch bitte die leeren Zeilen.","Please delete the empty rows."],["der","Wert","value","Der Wert fehlt in vielen Zeilen.","The value is missing in many rows."],["der","Mittelwert","mean / average","Der Mittelwert liegt bei zwanzig.","The mean is twenty."],["der","Median","median","Der Median ist robuster als der Mittelwert.","The median is more robust than the mean."],["die","Standardabweichung","standard deviation","Die Standardabweichung ist sehr groß.","The standard deviation is very large."],["die","Verteilung","distribution","Die Verteilung ist schief.","The distribution is skewed."],["die","Wahrscheinlichkeit","probability","Die Wahrscheinlichkeit ist gering.","The probability is low."],["die","Stichprobe","sample","Die Stichprobe ist zu klein.","The sample is too small."],["die","Statistik","statistics","Statistik ist die Basis meiner Arbeit.","Statistics is the basis of my work."],["die","Hypothese","hypothesis","Wir testen die Hypothese.","We are testing the hypothesis."],["die","Korrelation","correlation","Korrelation ist keine Kausalität.","Correlation is not causation."],["die","Regression","regression","Wir nutzen eine lineare Regression.","We use a linear regression."],["das","Modell","model","Das Modell sagt den Umsatz voraus.","The model predicts revenue."],["das","maschinelle Lernen","machine learning","Ich arbeite viel mit maschinellem Lernen.","I work a lot with machine learning."],["die","künstliche Intelligenz","artificial intelligence (AI)","Künstliche Intelligenz verändert viele Branchen.","Artificial intelligence is changing many industries."],["der","Algorithmus","algorithm","Der Algorithmus ist sehr schnell.","The algorithm is very fast."],["die","Vorhersage","prediction / forecast","Die Vorhersage war ziemlich genau.","The prediction was quite accurate."],["die","Genauigkeit","accuracy","Die Genauigkeit liegt bei neunzig Prozent.","The accuracy is ninety percent."],["der","Fehler","error / mistake","Der Fehler ist kleiner geworden.","The error has gotten smaller."],["die","Variable","variable","Diese Variable ist nicht wichtig.","This variable is not important."],["das","Merkmal","feature (in a model)","Wir brauchen bessere Merkmale.","We need better features."],["die","Trainingsdaten","training data (plural)","Die Trainingsdaten sind sauber.","The training data is clean."],["die","Testdaten","test data (plural)","Wir prüfen das Modell mit Testdaten.","We check the model with test data."],["die","Überanpassung","overfitting","Das Modell zeigt eine Überanpassung.","The model shows overfitting."],["das","Diagramm","chart / diagram","Das Diagramm zeigt den Trend.","The chart shows the trend."],["die","Grafik","graphic / plot","Kannst du die Grafik größer machen?","Can you make the plot bigger?"],["die","Auswertung","evaluation / analysis","Die Auswertung dauert eine Woche.","The analysis takes a week."],["die","Analyse","analysis","Die Analyse zeigt ein klares Muster.","The analysis shows a clear pattern."],["das","Muster","pattern","Ich sehe ein Muster in den Daten.","I see a pattern in the data."],["der","Ausreißer","outlier","Wir entfernen die Ausreißer.","We remove the outliers."],["die","Abfrage","query","Die Abfrage ist zu langsam.","The query is too slow."],["der","Code","code","Ich schreibe den Code in Python.","I write the code in Python."],["die","Kennzahl","metric / KPI","Welche Kennzahl ist am wichtigsten?","Which metric is the most important?"],["das","Ergebnis","result","Das Ergebnis ist signifikant.","The result is significant."],["","auswerten","to analyze / evaluate","Ich werte die Umfrage aus.","I’m analyzing the survey."],["","bereinigen","to clean (data)","Zuerst bereinigen wir die Daten.","First we clean the data."],["","trainieren","to train","Wir trainieren das Modell neu.","We’re retraining the model."],["","vorhersagen","to predict","Das Modell sagt die Nachfrage vorher.","The model predicts demand."],["","signifikant","significant","Der Unterschied ist statistisch signifikant.","The difference is statistically significant."]]}